  vector debug config        show resolved configuration
  vector debug lsp           LSP debugging utilities
  vector debug rg            ripgrep debugging utilities
  vector debug file          file system debugging utilities
  vector debug scrap         list all known projects
  vector debug skill         list all available skills
  vector debug snapshot      snapshot debugging utilities
  vector debug startup       print startup timing
  vector debug agent <name>  show agent configuration details
  vector debug v2            debug v2 catalog and built-in plugins
  vector debug info          show debug information
  vector debug paths         show global paths (data, config, cache, state)
